sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Patient / Caller
    participant Voice as Voice Layer (WebSockets)
    participant Agent as AI Agent Orchestrator
    participant Tool as Tool Dispatcher
    participant API as Clinic Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Caller,Voice: Egyptian Arabic Appointment Booking
    Caller->>Voice: "عايز أحجز مع دكتور قلب بكرة بعد الضهر"
    Voice->>Agent: Transcribed Text + Session ID
    
    Note over Agent: Intent: book_appointment<br/>Specialty: Cardiology<br/>Date: Tomorrow (YYYY-MM-DD)<br/>Period: Afternoon

    Agent->>Tool: find_doctors(specialty="Cardiology")
    Tool->>API: GET /api/v1/doctors?specialty=Cardiology
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM doctors WHERE specialty = 'Cardiology' AND is_active = true
    DB-->>API: Rows: [Dr. Sarah Farouk (ID: 12), ...]
    API-->>Tool: HTTP 200 OK (Doctor List)
    Tool-->>Agent: Returns Doctors

    Agent->>Tool: get_doctor_availability(doctor_id=12, date="2026-10-15")
    Tool->>API: GET /api/v1/doctors/12/availability?date=2026-10-15
    API->>DB: SELECT start_time FROM appointments WHERE doctor_id=12 AND appointment_date='2026-10-15'
    DB-->>API: Booked Slots
    API-->>Tool: HTTP 200 OK: available_slots: ["14:00", "15:00"]
    Tool-->>Agent: Returns Open Slots

    Agent->>Voice: Synthesize: "دكتورة سارة فاروق متاحة بكرة الساعة 2:00 و 3:00 بعد الضهر. تحب أحجزلك الساعة 2؟"
    Voice-->>Caller: Speaks Arabic Audio Response

    Caller->>Voice: "تمام الساعة 2"
    Voice->>Agent: "تمام الساعة 2" (Slot Selected & Confirmed)

    Note over Agent: User explicitly confirmed booking.<br/>Invoke state-altering tool.

    Agent->>Tool: book_appointment(patient_id=101, doctor_id=12, date="2026-10-15", time="14:00")
    Tool->>API: POST /api/v1/appointments {patient_id: 101, doctor_id: 12, date: "2026-10-15", time: "14:00"}
    
    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>DB: Check uniqueness & lock slot (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO appointments (...) VALUES (...)
    API->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB-->>API: New Appointment ID: 502
    API-->>Tool: HTTP 201 Created {id: 502, status: "scheduled"}
    Tool-->>Agent: Tool Success Envelope

    Agent->>Voice: Synthesize: "حجز حضرتك اتأكد مع دكتورة سارة بكرة الساعة 2:00 بعد الضهر. رقم الحجز 502."
    Voice-->>Caller: Speaks Confirmation Audio
